1
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:09,940
Hello, boys!

2
00:00:10,760 --> 00:00:12,920
Everyone's here working hard, I see.

3
00:00:12,920 --> 00:00:15,680
Today, I have someone lovely...

4
00:00:15,680 --> 00:00:17,800
to introduce to all of you.

5
00:00:17,800 --> 00:00:20,700
This is our new intern

6
00:00:20,700 --> 00:00:23,200
in my department.

7
00:00:23,200 --> 00:00:26,620
Hello, I'm Jomkaen. Please take good care of me.

8
00:00:27,660 --> 00:00:28,980
Jomkaen...

9
00:00:28,980 --> 00:00:32,840
Don't worry. Working here with us,

10
00:00:32,840 --> 00:00:38,380
we treat each other like family—very chill and relaxed.

11
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:41,400
Looks cute.

12
00:00:42,760 --> 00:00:43,740
Yes.

13
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:46,840
Uh... Jomkaen said it's cute. Ah... we're cute, too.

14
00:00:46,840 --> 00:00:49,260
Sitting around like a cute family.

15
00:00:49,260 --> 00:00:49,900
Uh...

16
00:00:49,900 --> 00:00:51,600
Boss?

17
00:00:51,600 --> 00:00:51,980
Yes?

18
00:00:51,980 --> 00:00:54,760
I think the big boss was looking for you just now.

19
00:00:56,220 --> 00:00:57,260
Khun Ton.

20
00:00:57,660 --> 00:00:58,900
Yes?

21
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,820
Yes.

22
00:01:06,140 --> 00:01:06,860
How are you?

23
00:01:06,860 --> 00:01:07,900
Doing good.

24
00:01:07,900 --> 00:01:08,820
How have you been?

25
00:01:09,080 --> 00:01:11,440
Glad we're interning at the same place, Pond.

26
00:02:24,840 --> 00:02:28,080
EP.10 Loop

27
00:02:32,760 --> 00:02:35,700
I'm here to hand in the Team Building report, Khun Ton.

28
00:02:39,640 --> 00:02:40,360
Have a seat.

29
00:02:42,460 --> 00:02:43,000
Thank you.

30
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,560
I saw my brother's story.

31
00:02:53,920 --> 00:02:55,680
I don't hold a prejudice against you.

32
00:02:56,620 --> 00:02:57,500
But...

33
00:02:59,300 --> 00:03:01,300
I don't think

34
00:03:01,540 --> 00:03:03,660
you truly love my brother.

35
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,940
I really like Tontae, Khun Ton.

36
00:03:08,440 --> 00:03:11,480
When I'm with Tontae, I feel really good.

37
00:03:12,580 --> 00:03:14,000
And I think

38
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,880
if we officially date,

39
00:03:17,040 --> 00:03:18,540
it will be even better, Khun Ton.

40
00:03:19,980 --> 00:03:21,820
That's such a childish way of thinking.

41
00:03:23,480 --> 00:03:24,980
And have you ever wondered

42
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:27,240
if my brother truly loves you?

43
00:03:28,520 --> 00:03:29,660
Or is he

44
00:03:29,920 --> 00:03:31,940
just using you

45
00:03:31,940 --> 00:03:34,560
to replace someone else?

46
00:03:41,840 --> 00:03:43,560
Now about work, Khun Best.

47
00:03:44,100 --> 00:03:45,780
You're very capable.

48
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:46,500
Yes.

49
00:03:47,880 --> 00:03:50,360
You know how to conduct yourself. You're smart.

50
00:03:51,200 --> 00:03:54,280
And I believe you know how to find ways

51
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:57,700
to benefit yourself quite well.

52
00:03:58,360 --> 00:04:01,220
I've never intended to take advantage of your brother.

53
00:04:01,220 --> 00:04:03,460
I only just found out that your brother

54
00:04:03,460 --> 00:04:05,080
is Tontae.

55
00:04:05,080 --> 00:04:06,920
Prove it then.

56
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,760
Why don't you prove it?

57
00:04:09,260 --> 00:04:13,040
How about increasing your KPI targets by 50%?

58
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:16,160
And that applies to every single metric.

59
00:04:16,460 --> 00:04:18,220
Every single metric, Khun Ton?

60
00:04:20,820 --> 00:04:22,700
Also, during this time,

61
00:04:22,700 --> 00:04:26,900
I don't think the two of you should see each other.

62
00:04:27,940 --> 00:04:29,040
How does that sound?

63
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,600
What if Tontae comes to stay with me?

64
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:37,560
You shouldn't forbid him.

65
00:04:37,560 --> 00:04:39,400
You're truly in love, right?

66
00:04:40,540 --> 00:04:42,840
Both you and my brother.

67
00:04:42,840 --> 00:04:45,280
In the meantime, stay away from each other.

68
00:04:45,280 --> 00:04:47,440
I don't think I can stop Tontae.

69
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,860
Then make sure you do.

70
00:04:48,860 --> 00:04:50,940
If your love is genuine,

71
00:04:50,940 --> 00:04:53,000
or are you just using my brother for personal gain?

72
00:04:53,600 --> 00:04:56,060
Alright. I'll make sure to do it, Khun Ton.

73
00:04:57,180 --> 00:04:59,600
Okay. That's all I wanted to talk to you about.

74
00:04:59,600 --> 00:05:01,780
You may get back to work.

75
00:05:04,240 --> 00:05:05,080
Um...

76
00:05:05,420 --> 00:05:08,800
Actually, I have one question I'd like to ask you, Khun Ton.

77
00:05:08,800 --> 00:05:10,260
Sure, go ahead.

78
00:05:10,820 --> 00:05:12,720
Are the two of you really biological brothers?

79
00:05:14,020 --> 00:05:15,680
If you really want to know,

80
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:19,360
we'd have to go back to my father's time.

81
00:05:30,020 --> 00:05:30,800
Best!

82
00:05:31,660 --> 00:05:32,960
Did you adjust the KPIs?

83
00:05:33,860 --> 00:05:36,620
You just adjusted them at the beginning of the year.

84
00:05:36,740 --> 00:05:40,680
It's almost year-end, and you bump them up another 50%? Who can do that?!

85
00:05:41,680 --> 00:05:43,120
We can.

86
00:05:43,660 --> 00:05:45,560
It's time you helped me out, Dan.

87
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,540
Help with what the hell?

88
00:05:46,540 --> 00:05:49,620
50% in 6 months! Who on earth can achieve that?

89
00:05:49,620 --> 00:05:52,180
What do you expect us to do, work 80 hours a day?

90
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:54,940
I don't know.

91
00:05:54,940 --> 00:05:56,580
I just have to pull it off.

92
00:05:57,600 --> 00:06:00,080
If I can't... I'd probably...

93
00:06:04,520 --> 00:06:05,060
What?

94
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:07,420
If you fail, you...

95
00:06:07,420 --> 00:06:08,840
You're acting as if

96
00:06:10,300 --> 00:06:12,600
if you fail, you'll have to break up with Tontae.

97
00:06:16,280 --> 00:06:19,120
Well, Tontae is Khun Ton's brother.

98
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,040
Huh?

99
00:06:22,520 --> 00:06:23,880
That's the thing.

100
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:26,160
Khun Ton called me in to talk,

101
00:06:26,720 --> 00:06:28,980
forbidding me from dating his brother

102
00:06:28,980 --> 00:06:31,120
unless I hit these targets.

103
00:06:31,740 --> 00:06:34,300
My god... I get it now.

104
00:06:34,840 --> 00:06:38,300
But what crazy person mixes personal stuff with work this much?

105
00:06:39,600 --> 00:06:41,140
I think

106
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:43,140
he wants to test

107
00:06:43,920 --> 00:06:46,140
whether I can truly take care of his brother.

108
00:06:46,140 --> 00:06:47,800
And I also want to know

109
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:49,920
if Tontae truly loves me.

110
00:06:50,580 --> 00:06:52,140
I thought Pond was dramatic enough,

111
00:06:52,140 --> 00:06:53,880
but are you living in a vertical web drama or something?

112
00:06:53,880 --> 00:06:55,540
I'm serious, Dan.

113
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,780
Yeah, fine...

114
00:06:58,780 --> 00:07:02,120
As for work, you and I just have to push through.

115
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,760
So how are you going to tell Tontae?

116
00:07:03,760 --> 00:07:05,520
You're going to disappear completely like this.

117
00:07:05,520 --> 00:07:07,680
Will you even have time to see him?

118
00:07:11,080 --> 00:07:12,500
I'll probably just let it slide.

119
00:07:13,240 --> 00:07:14,740
I'll just fade away.

120
00:07:15,400 --> 00:07:16,740
Without saying anything?

121
00:07:16,740 --> 00:07:19,380
Are you really going to pull off a cold ghosting routine

122
00:07:19,380 --> 00:07:21,160
and just walk away without telling him anything?

123
00:07:22,200 --> 00:07:24,240
I wish I could just walk away easily, too.

124
00:07:28,460 --> 00:07:30,340
Yeah, that's gonna be tough.

125
00:07:32,200 --> 00:07:33,480
Really tough.

126
00:07:53,800 --> 00:07:55,600
Yay! You're back, Best.

127
00:07:57,800 --> 00:07:59,440
Why are you waiting here?

128
00:07:59,440 --> 00:08:00,800
Well,

129
00:08:00,800 --> 00:08:02,580
I was waiting for you

130
00:08:02,580 --> 00:08:04,100
so we could go back together.

131
00:08:05,740 --> 00:08:07,080
Do you wait like this every day?

132
00:08:07,080 --> 00:08:08,400
Yes.

133
00:08:15,460 --> 00:08:16,120
Ton...

134
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:16,960
Yeah?

135
00:08:19,020 --> 00:08:20,740
From now on, you don't need to wait for me anymore.

136
00:08:30,860 --> 00:08:32,920
What's wrong with you?

137
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,160
Where are you going?

138
00:08:46,840 --> 00:08:49,420
Kaen and someone from the department invited me to a movie.

139
00:08:50,260 --> 00:08:52,180
Kaen likes the same movie genre as me, too.

140
00:08:55,240 --> 00:08:58,600
Besides, it premieres today, so I'm scared my friends will spoil it for me.

141
00:09:01,380 --> 00:09:02,720
Kaen?

142
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,040
What?

143
00:09:09,040 --> 00:09:10,720
Don't you want me to go?

144
00:09:11,320 --> 00:09:14,380
If you want to spend time with me, just say so.

145
00:09:14,560 --> 00:09:17,460
No... I just want to eat.

146
00:09:18,680 --> 00:09:20,160
You miss my home cooking, don't you?

147
00:09:23,360 --> 00:09:23,960
Am I right?

148
00:09:26,240 --> 00:09:28,120
Hold on a sec.

149
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,200
Hello?

150
00:09:37,740 --> 00:09:39,500
Hey, I won't be able to make it after all.

151
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:43,920
Suddenly, my heart started racing...

152
00:09:44,500 --> 00:09:45,320
Hear that?

153
00:09:47,320 --> 00:09:48,180
Oh.

154
00:09:49,860 --> 00:09:51,640
I think I'll stay in my room.

155
00:09:52,220 --> 00:09:53,640
Sorry about that!

156
00:09:58,820 --> 00:10:00,540
Did you really just ditch your friend like that?

157
00:10:00,540 --> 00:10:02,520
Well, I'd rather stay here with you.

158
00:10:07,060 --> 00:10:09,300
Don't you want to be with me?

159
00:10:14,360 --> 00:10:15,880
Go cook then.

160
00:10:20,060 --> 00:10:21,780
Come make it with me.

161
00:10:32,760 --> 00:10:33,840
I really love it

162
00:10:33,840 --> 00:10:36,780
when you want me around.

163
00:10:36,780 --> 00:10:39,400
Didn't it occur to you that I was just hungry?

164
00:10:41,380 --> 00:10:42,860
Keep playing tough all you want.

165
00:10:50,480 --> 00:10:51,420
Who are you texting?

166
00:10:52,380 --> 00:10:53,780
Best.

167
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,380
Hey...

168
00:10:57,380 --> 00:10:59,420
What's the deal between those two?

169
00:11:00,300 --> 00:11:04,600
Ton said Best has been indifferent to him.

170
00:11:09,320 --> 00:11:11,280
How about saving yourself first?

171
00:11:12,880 --> 00:11:14,800
And how am I supposed to save myself from you?

172
00:11:17,440 --> 00:11:18,880
Are you not going to give it a rest at all?

173
00:11:19,620 --> 00:11:22,380
I could go all day like this.

174
00:11:28,600 --> 00:11:30,220
Whoa...

175
00:11:39,040 --> 00:11:40,220
Ugh, I don't want to watch this anymore.

176
00:11:40,220 --> 00:11:41,300
Huh?

177
00:11:43,120 --> 00:11:45,100
If you love her, why let her go?

178
00:11:46,060 --> 00:11:47,960
Maybe he has his reasons.

179
00:11:49,340 --> 00:11:51,340
Just because the female lead is plain,

180
00:11:51,700 --> 00:11:52,580
messy-haired,

181
00:11:52,580 --> 00:11:53,640
wears glasses,

182
00:11:53,640 --> 00:11:54,700
and looks nerdy...

183
00:11:55,120 --> 00:11:57,600
And then she gets insecure, thinking she's not good enough for him.

184
00:11:57,600 --> 00:11:58,880
Did she even ask him

185
00:11:58,880 --> 00:12:01,420
if he was actually okay with it?

186
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:11,940
Ow... My neck hurts so bad.

187
00:12:12,760 --> 00:12:14,420
My whole body aches.

188
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:16,260
Since my whole body aches, can I just sleep here?

189
00:12:17,800 --> 00:12:19,280
Then don't sleep.

190
00:12:20,380 --> 00:12:21,880
But I want to sleep with you.

191
00:12:22,880 --> 00:12:23,740
Ouch!

192
00:12:24,920 --> 00:12:26,300
Do I look like a bed to you?

193
00:12:26,300 --> 00:12:27,780
That hurt!

194
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:30,060
You have to take responsibility for me.

195
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:34,360
And how exactly am I supposed to do that?

196
00:12:35,060 --> 00:12:37,040
By letting me sleep on the sofa with you.

197
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:44,120
If you want to sleep, just sleep.

198
00:12:44,120 --> 00:12:45,160
I'm leaving.

199
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:50,120
Dan, that's my room!

200
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,880
If you're going to sleep there, you have to let me sleep, too!

201
00:13:30,260 --> 00:13:33,180
Is there anything I can help you with? I want to help.

202
00:13:38,760 --> 00:13:41,260
Let me work for a bit, okay?

203
00:13:49,920 --> 00:13:51,740
Hey... What kind of work are you doing?

204
00:13:52,420 --> 00:13:54,020
Let me see!

205
00:13:58,620 --> 00:14:00,000
Best...

206
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:03,240
Ever since we came back, you've seemed stressed.

207
00:14:03,380 --> 00:14:05,260
Is something wrong?

208
00:14:12,320 --> 00:14:14,140
I just have a few things on my mind.

209
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:17,280
Can I help? I can help you out.

210
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:25,760
Then...

211
00:14:29,600 --> 00:14:31,260
Could you give me some time?

212
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:37,080
Are you messing with me right now?

213
00:14:41,920 --> 00:14:44,020
I just want us

214
00:14:45,320 --> 00:14:47,600
to take a break for a while. Can we?

215
00:15:00,320 --> 00:15:01,400
What the hell is wrong with you?

216
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,800
Since coming back from out of town,

217
00:15:05,800 --> 00:15:08,000
you've been giving me the silent treatment for 3 to 4 days.

218
00:15:08,000 --> 00:15:09,960
And today, when we finally spend time together,

219
00:15:09,960 --> 00:15:11,840
you tell me to take a break?!

220
00:15:13,420 --> 00:15:14,940
Just taking a break for a while.

221
00:15:14,940 --> 00:15:16,940
How long is "a while"?

222
00:15:16,940 --> 00:15:18,100
How many days?!

223
00:15:20,720 --> 00:15:22,620
I just...

224
00:15:23,020 --> 00:15:25,480
want to think over whether we can really be together.

225
00:15:30,480 --> 00:15:33,120
Are you not sure if I want to be with you?

226
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:38,100
Or are you not sure if YOU want to be with ME?

227
00:15:38,300 --> 00:15:39,820
That's not it, Ton.

228
00:15:39,820 --> 00:15:42,340
I just wanted to...

229
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:47,520
I'm really hurt, you know?

230
00:15:50,380 --> 00:15:52,600
I'm going upstairs to cry.

231
00:15:53,140 --> 00:15:55,300
Do you hear me? I'm going upstairs to cry now!

232
00:16:03,360 --> 00:16:05,680
And I'm going to cry really out loud!

233
00:16:13,500 --> 00:16:15,760
What the hell is wrong with you?!

234
